{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Meet Byte, My Cat! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Byte isn\u2019t conducting his <i>gravity experiments </i>(knocking stuff off counters) or <i>battling his arch-nemesis</i> (the mirror), he\u2019s utterly entranced with soap bubbles. This fluffball <u>demanded</u> I turn his fascination into a game... so here we are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/byteswipe.gif?t=1740696956\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udee7 What Even Is <i>BubbleByte</i>?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A whimsical <strong>incremental clicker/idle hybrid</strong> with <strong>tower defense </strong>elements! Start as a lone bubble-popper, build a cat army, and uncover strategic synergies that\u2019ll make your inner cat lady (or dude) purr.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/ezgif-410576cc2615a2.gif?t=1740696956\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Gameplay 101 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong><i>Pop bubbles</i></strong><i> \u2192 <strong>hire cats</strong> \u2192 <strong>dominate the skies</strong>!</i></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f Click:</strong> Rack up <i>combos</i> and <i>cash</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc08\u00a0<strong>Recruit</strong>: From <i>lazy paw-swipers</i> to <i>bomb-throwing Devilcats</i>, <u>automate</u> your empire!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Invest</strong>: Unlock <i>upgrades</i>, <i>powers</i>, <i>new cats</i>, and discover purr-fect synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explore</strong>: Discover <i>mysterious shrines</i> where <i>extraordinary rare cats</i> are sealed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd04\u00a0<strong>Ascend</strong>: Sacrifice progress to <i>prestige</i>, gaining <u>permanent</u> upgrades and unique powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/ezgif-43ebe293ee1ace.gif?t=1740696956\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong>\ud83e\udd14\u00a0<strong>Pick Your Vibe</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\uddd8 Zen Master</strong>: Sip tea while cats do <i>all</i> the work (judging you).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc79\u00a0<strong>Clicker Demon</strong>: Chase <i>x25 combos</i> until your mouse smokes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/ezgif-49350628436a7f.gif?t=1740696956\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Features That Pop </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc31\u00a0<strong>Cats</strong>: <i>Unicats</i>, <i>Devilcats</i>, and more \u2014 each with <u>unique</u> abilities and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf\u00a0<strong>Play Your Way</strong>: <i>Tower defense brainiac</i> or <i>zen bubble ASMR enthusiast</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80\u00a0<strong>Prestige with Purpose</strong>: Unlock <u><i>game-breaking</i></u><i> perks</i>, not just boring +1% bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf10\u00a0<strong>Endless Scale</strong>: Expand your map to host <i>thousands</i> of bubbles and cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Replay for Glory</strong>: Try\u00a0<i>speedrunning </i>milestones\u00a0after your first playthrough!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6\u00a0<strong>300+ Achievements</strong>: For <i>completionists</i> and <i>casual popaholics</i> alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/bbgifchaos.gif?t=1740696956\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc96 Crafted With </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0b\u00a0<strong>Zero Cash Grabs</strong>: Everything\u2019s included! No ads, no &quot;gem&quot; BS \u2014 just cats being weird.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf5e\u00a0<strong>Toasters In Mind</strong>: Runs flawlessly even on your laptop from 2001.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbb\u00a0<strong>Open-Source Code</strong>: Rip it apart, make a <i>Dog Mode</i>, whatever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udeae\u00a0<strong>Actual Cat Hair</strong>: Byte shed on my keyboard throughout development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/bbgifcats.gif?t=1740696956\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Join the Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Pop, strategize, explore, and ascend \u2014 your feline empire awaits!</strong></i></u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499760?t=1740696956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740696956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/46279678f98981a7ac005f7557acfb78d4e7cb66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740696956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/46279678f98981a7ac005f7557acfb78d4e7cb66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740696956","categories":[{"description":"