, <i>powers</i>, <i>new cats</i>, and discover purr-fect synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explore</strong>: Discover <i>mysterious shrines</i> where <i>extraordinary rare cats</i> are sealed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd04\u00a0<strong>Ascend</strong>: Sacrifice progress to <i>prestige</i>, gaining <u>permanent</u> upgrades and unique powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/ezgif-43ebe293ee1ace.gif?t=1740696956\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong>\ud83e\udd14\u00a0<strong>Pick Your Vibe</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\uddd8 Zen Master</strong>: Sip tea while cats do <i>all</i> the work (judging you).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc79\u00a0<strong>Clicker Demon</strong>: Chase <i>x25 combos</i> until your mouse smokes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499760/extras/ezgif-49350628436a7f.gif?t=1740696956\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Features That Pop </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc31\u00a0<strong>Cats</strong>: <i>Unicats</i>, <i>Devilcats</i>, and more \u2014 each with <u>unique</u> abilities and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf\u00a0<strong>Play Your Way</strong>: <i>Tower defense brainiac</i> or <i>zen bubble ASMR enthusiast</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80\u00a0<strong>Prestige with Purpose</strong>: Unlock <u><i>game-breaking</i></u><i> perks</i>, not just boring +1% bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf10\u00a0<strong>Endless Scale</strong>: Expand your map to host <i>thousands</i> of bubbles and cats.</p></li><li><p clas